  "job_B20.20.1_20251003_114511": {
    "chunk_text": "on beo\u00f0 nigontyne: swa lange yrn\u00f0 se circul, & on \u00feam circule syndon seofon gear \u00dea endlufon gear \u00fee beo\u00f0 \u00e6fter \u00feam eahta gearum hatton on Grecisc endekade, & on Lyden xicim, So\u00f0lice on \u00feam endlyftan geare \u00fe\u00e6s circules, \u00feonne se forma embolismus by\u00f0 on \u00feam endecade, & se mona by\u00f0 embolismus. On tertia non Ianuarii luna prima, & on pridie kl Februarii xxix on kl Februarii xxx: \u00fees mona On quarta n Februarii luna prima; on pridie kl Martii luna xxvii; on kl Martii xxviii; on vi non Witodlice se mona, \u00fee ongin\u00f0 on v non Martii niwe & by\u00f0 adw\u00e6sced o\u00f0\u00f0e geendod \u00ferittig nihta & se mona, \u00fee by\u00f0 anre nihte eald on iiii non Aprelis, he by\u00f0 Aprilis, & he by\u00f0 adw\u00e6sced nigon & & se \u00f0e ongin\u00f0 prima on kl Mai, he by\u00f0 his; & he sceal geendian \u00ferittig nihta eald. \u00dea o\u00f0re fylia\u00f0 heora gewunan. Be \u00feam O\u00f0rum Embolismum. De secundo anno embolismi \u00fee by\u00f0 on \u00feam endecade, synt, swa seo r\u00e6ding cwy\u00f0, \u00fereo & twentig So\u00f0lice se mona \u00fee by\u00f0 on kl Nouembris xxx. & \u00fe\u00e6r geenda\u00f0, he by\u00f0 his mona. & se \u00f0e geenda\u00f0 on kl Decembris xxx, se by\u00f0 embolismus. & se \u00f0e by\u00f0 prima on quarta non December, & geenda\u00f0 xxix on iiii kl Ianuarii, he by\u00f0 Decembris. On pridie kl Ianuarii prima; on iii kl Februarii xxx,",
